// ---- photo frame pairing codes (photo-frames ADR-0001) ----
// Closed for the same reason kid pairings are: a readable collection of
// codes is a list of ways to put a screen in somebody's home.
// `startFramePairing`, `pollFramePairing` and `claimFramePairing` are the
// only way in.
match /framePairings/{code} {
  allow read, write: if false;
}
